$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture and Hold\n<f1>Planet: <f0> UberPrime\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Not Too Bad\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Day\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Two ship's have crashed landed on this planet after a duel from above. It would seem they have crash landed by 3 Energy Towers wich only have enough power for repairs to one ship.. So now the fight has been tooken to the grounds for the 3 Energy Towers.\n\n<f1>Created by:<f0> King Shit{|XK|}\n\n<f1>Go get em!:<f0> You can find this map along with several others at<f2> http://www.planetstarsiege.com/catalog/<f0>.\n\n<f1>Custom Objects made by:<f0> I took most of the objects I put in this map from the mappers mod & all the other such as the dead body's were created by<f2> Kill_em_all_first<f0> .";
